abstract: >-
  A learning-focused reinforcement-learning project for a custom simulated
  highway-driving task, combining a frozen QR-DQN policy, a confidence-gated
  preference residual, and deterministic safety and speed-control layers.
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - simulated driving
  - QR-DQN
  - RLAIF
  - Gymnasium
